  "implementation_gaps": [
    "USB3300 ULPI logic is connected to the 1.8 V A-side of U4/U5: STP cannot meet the 2.0 V VIH minimum and PHY outputs exceed the translator A-side recommended input range; schematic-based deployment blocker, actual assembly not measured",
    "Native custom-board top-level ports, reset policy and complete IO electrical constraints are not implemented",
    "USB2 ULPI Host transport, 48/60 MHz domain transfer and PHY recovery are not implemented",
    "DAC identity, serial format, MCLK and power/mute sequencing are not verified or implemented",
    "All four serialized TMDS lanes require polarity compensation before their native differential buffers",
    "K14 is CEC, not the old transmitter-enable output; open-drain handling is not implemented",
    "Audio cable and resistor-array pairing and Bluetooth cable continuity remain explicit assumptions",
    "New routed timing, CDC, PLL, functional and physical hardware acceptance are required"
  ],
